## Description

Your perfect companion for a walk in the city where you need only a few items with you. This small card holder is also ideal if you want a discrete wallet to put in a thin jacket or pocket. 🤵

This minimalist wallet is made to hold 2 cards on the 1 card on each side pocket and around 3-4 cards or any bills and tickets in the middle pocket.

Its middle thumb hole on one side is made to easily push the cards from the pocket, if pulling is not your thing 😁👍

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

